\dWho could it be at a time like this? Wonder if it's one\nof those newspaper salesmen again.\d%K%P
「什么啊？在吃饭的时候。\n推销报纸的么」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYes?\d%K%P
「哪位？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEh? Ah, Yes. Yes... Um, that's right...?\d%K%P
「诶？啊，是的、是的…\n虽然是这样…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHuh? I see. All right, I understand. Just a moment.\d%K%P
「啊，这样么。\n嗯嗯，我知道了，请稍等一下」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSorry, looks like I have a guest, so feel free to start\neating without me.\d%K%P
「抱歉，你先吃吧。\n有客人」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't just-- Whoa whoa whoa!!\d%K%P
「那种事不用…咕！\n哇哇哇！」%K%P
Ms. Kaya suddenly took her shirt off as soon as she left\nthe intercom. She was now completely naked aside from her\npanties.%K%P
我还以为夏夜小姐要放下对讲机，\n谁知她匆忙脱下了衬衫，只剩下一条内裤了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI asked you not to change in this room... Uhh...\d%K%P
「所以说不要在这里脱衣服啊…唔唔…」%K%P
In that moment, the pink color around the center of her\nbreasts was irrevocably burned into my retinas, making\nboth the food in my throat and something else shoot up in\na violent burst.%K%P
仅仅一瞬间，在我的视网膜上刻下了粉红色，\n她这一下子站起来的盛景真是秀色可餐。%K%P
Not like I hadn't already seen that multiple times through\nher shirt, but...%K%P
不，嘛，虽然以前也能充分透过白布看到粉色的位置就是了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI gotta change, right? I wonder where my skirt\ndisappeared to.\d%K%P
「要换衣服嘛，没办法不是。\n啊～，裙子在哪里啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou left it on the bed, so I figured I'd put it in the\ncloset.\d%K%P
「因为你扔到了床上，\n我就挂在那的壁橱里了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, sorry 'bout that. Now that I think about it, I\nhaven't actually worn it in three days.\d%K%P
「啊～，抱歉抱歉。啊哈哈。\n这个三天没穿了」%K%P
She went out of her way to iron my things, yet when it\ncame to her own clothes, she seemed to be thoroughly\ncareless and laidback.%K%P
明明都能用电熨斗帮我熨衣服的，\n对于自己的东西却相当不检点，这个人啊…%K%P
...No wonder she ended up burning my things.%K%P
嘛，虽然拜她所赐，衣服被烧焦了就是了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh, and I might take a while, so I meant it when I said\nyou could go ahead and start eating.\d%K%P
「啊～，还有，可能会稍微花点时间，\n你不用客气，先吃吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'll wait.\d%K%P
「我会等你的」%K%P
I had enough of that during my childhood.%K%P
在我还是孩子的时候，就已经厌腻一个人吃饭了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dReally? Well, guess I can't force you. At least drink\nyour beer, though.\d%K%P
「是么？不好意思啊。\n那你就先喝点啤酒吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I suppose one sip couldn't hurt.\d%K%P
「那，我就先喝一杯了」%K%P
There was no point in arguing, so I made a toast to Ms.\nKaya -- who had, by now, finished changing -- and stuffed\nsome smoked cheese into my mouth.%K%P
在我过分的坚持之下，\n换完衣服的的夏夜小姐喝了点酒，\n往嘴里放了一块熏制奶酪。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBy the way, Osamu.\d%K%P
「说起来，理君」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes?\d%K%P
「怎么了？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThe apartment you used to live in... What was it called\nagain? Terrace House something?\d%K%P
「你住的公寓，好像是，那个…\nTerrace House…什么的？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe Terrace House Hinosaka.\d%K%P
「Terrace House阳之坂…」%K%P
I'd feel something prick my heart every time I uttered\nthat name.%K%P
一说出那个名字，我感到心被什么东西扎了一下。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI see. I knew it.\d%K%P
「是么，果然啊…」%K%P
A promise unfulfilled. The harsh truth of reality.%K%P
还没完成的约定。\n摆在面前的现实。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Is something wrong?\d%K%P
「…怎么了？」%K%P
The pathetic fantasies of an equally pathetic man.%K%P
可恶的回忆，失落，愧疚，\n让我这个可耻男人的可耻一面显露无遗。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYour landlord's here.\d%K%P
「房东小姐来了哦」%K%P
All I was able to do was raise expectations, and then\nbetray them like...%K%P
明明让她满怀期待了的，\n到头来留下的也只有大大的失望而已…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dGulp, gulp, gulp.\d%K%P
「嗯咕、嗯咕、嗯咕」%K%P
I gulped down an entire bottle of beer, hoping it would\nhit me hard enough to make me forget all this.%K%P
我只好将突然变苦了的凉啤酒\n一口气灌入喉咙里，来逃避现实。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...PWHHHH?!?!?!?\d%K%P
「………噗～～～！？」%K%P
WHAT DID SHE JUST SAY?!%K%P
呃，谁来了！？%K%P
