I mean, the stench of the beer I belched up would probably\nstay unless I cleaned this up.%K%P
洒的啤酒放着不管自行干了的话是会发臭的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dU-Um... Look... Osamu, I mean, Mr. Laid-off... Ah, no...\nAh, that's right, Yoshimura! I-I heard that a person by\nthat name is here...\d%K%P
