%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThat sure is inauspicious. ...But he's doing perfectly\nfine. You can relax.\d%K%P
「真的没有…没事，他活蹦乱跳着呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI... I see... Thank God. I was so scared...\d%K%P
「是，是么…太好了。\n真的是、太好了啊」%K%P
