%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...What's that supposed to mean?\d%K%P
「…什么意思？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, but I wonder if I should let you go on your own. Want\nme to see you to the station? Or maybe call you a taxi?\d%K%P
「啊，你是一个人回去么？\n那我送你到车站吧？\n还是说要打车？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI-I'm the landlord of the Terrace House Hinosaka! The\nplace where Mr. Laid-off lives belongs to me, okay?! And I\nbelieve you are being very rude right now! I am not a\nchild!\d%K%P
「我、我是Terrace House阳之坂的房东！\n是失业先生的房主！\n把我当孩子看待，太失礼了！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAdults don't overreact like this, though.\d%K%P
