\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPhew, perfect.\d%K%P
「好…完美」%K%P
After I finished sweeping the puddle of beer I'd made, I\nfigured I might as well clean the entire room while I was\nat it.%K%P
我用沾湿的抹布擦完洒上啤酒的地板后，\n不知不觉来了兴致，把整个地板都擦了一遍。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's so hot...\d%K%P
「好热…」%K%P
I could feel beads of sweat on my forehead. I bet a cold\nbeer would taste fantastic right about now.%K%P
大干了一场，稍微流了点汗。\n啤酒肯定会因此而更好喝吧。%K%P
Yesterday, Ms. Kaya used some Quick Wipes to clean the\nfloor, but I guess you can never underestimate a good\nhand-sweeping -- my dust cloth had turned almost black at\nthis point.%K%P
虽然昨天夏夜小姐用了洗刷器，\n不过即便如此，湿抹布还是变得相当黑了。%K%P
I started cleaning the room when there was dinner on the\ntable. Ms. Kaya was going to be quite surprised when she\ncame back.%K%P
吃饭的时候突然开始扫除，\n夏夜小姐回来之后大概会大吃一惊吧。%K%P
I'd spent three days in this room, but she hadn't allowed\nme to help her with any domestic chores. I was losing my\nstatus in society by the minute.%K%P
可我已经在这打扰了三天，\n在这期间，她几乎没让我帮忙做家务。\n我真的快要成为真正的衣来伸手的小白脸了…%K%P
As such, this was my way of paying her back. As a wise old\nman once said, 'tis a foolish bird that defiles its own\nnest.%K%P
是的，这个，也算是报恩。\n好来不如好去，\n或者说是必须得尽的义务吧。%K%P
Anyway, basically...%K%P
因此，那个，就是说。%K%P
What I meant was...%K%P
总之…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShit. Wh-What should I do? What should I do...?\d%K%P
「怎、怎么办、怎么办…」%K%P
I knew full well that this was merely a lousy attempt at\nescaping reality.%K%P
我知道，我是知道的。\n这只不过是在逃避现实而已…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI-Is Mr. Laid-off inside? This is starting to look kind\nof suspicious to me.\d%K%P
「失、失业先生真的在房间里么？\n总觉得好可疑」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHe is. What else do you want me to say...?\d%K%P
「都说他在了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen why doesn't he come out? Ah, could it be that all\nthe stress from what happened caused some sort of\ntemporary amnesia? Does he even know where or who he is\nwith right now...?\d%K%P
「那为什么不出来？\n啊，难道说他是遭遇到接二连三的打击而怅然若失，\n已经糊涂得不知道是自己是和谁在一起了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...And why on earth would that be the case?\d%K%P
「…为什么你会这么认为？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean, I...! ...His landlord is here to see him.\d%K%P
「因为，我………\n明明房东都特意来见他了的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHahh... Don't you get it?\d%K%P
「哈啊…你还是没明白么」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWh-What...?\d%K%P
「什、什么…？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dUm, first off, let me tell you why Osamu is here, okay?\nHe has no home to go back to right now.\d%K%P
「那个啊，我来告诉你为什么理君在这里吧。\n他啊…无家可归了哦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...What?\d%K%P
「………为什么？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, I guess that's because he has a very caring\nlandlord. Too caring, in fact.\d%K%P
「那还不是因为房东小姐喜欢关心别人吧？\n甚至在没必要的时候」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't... understand.\d%K%P
「意思…不明白」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI guess it's a bit too much to swallow for the kid who\npointed out that the Emperor's naked.\d%K%P
「喊出国王没穿衣服的孩子也许是不会明白的」\n※译注：出自《皇帝的新装》。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dY-You're treating me like a child again!\d%K%P
「又、又把我当孩子了！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI meant that you were too honest for you own good,\nactually.\d%K%P
「我的意思是说你是个诚实的人啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou called me a kid!!\d%K%P
「但你也说了『孩子』嘛！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWait!!\d%K%P
「等一下！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Laid-off...?!\d%K%P
「失业…唔！？」%K%P
After a dozen or so seconds, I worked up the courage to\npress my ear against the door and listen in on what was\ngoing on outside...%K%P
我鼓起勇气，靠近玄关隔着门，\n侧着耳朵听了数十秒。%K%P
My legs finally felt like they could take a step forward,\nas I realized their conversation was becoming\nuncomfortably heated.%K%P
就在两个人的对话\n马上要陷入尴尬的境地之时，\n我的脚总算往前迈了一步。%K%P
...I wasn't exactly sure as to why they were arguing,\nthough.%K
…为什么两个人争吵起来了啊，\n老实说，我不是很清楚。%K
Please stop, Ms. Kaya!
夏夜小姐，请别这样
Calm down, Mitoko!
美都子，冷静点
